  "reference": "Titus 2",
  "verseCount": 15,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "2",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "TIT 2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "2",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But speak thou the things which befit the sound doctrine: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "that aged men be temperate, grave, sober-minded, sound in faith, in love, in patience: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "that aged women likewise be reverent in demeanor, not slanderers nor enslaved to much wine, teachers of that which is good; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "that they may train the young women to love their husbands, to love their children, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " sober-minded, chaste, workers at home, kind, being in subjection to their own husbands, that the word of God be not blasphemed: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the younger men likewise exhort to be sober-minded: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in all things showing thyself an ensample of good works; in thy doctrine ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " uncorruptness, gravity, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sound speech, that cannot be condemned; that he that is of the contrary part may be ashamed, having no evil thing to say of us. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " servants to be in subjection to their own masters, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " to be well-pleasing ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " in all things; not gainsaying; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "not purloining, but showing all good fidelity; that they may adorn the doctrine of God our Saviour in all things. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For the grace of God hath appeared, bringing salvation to all men, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "instructing us, to the intent that, denying ungodliness and worldly lusts, we should live soberly and righteously and godly in this present world; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "looking for the blessed hope and appearing of the glory of the great God and our Saviour Jesus Christ; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "who gave himself for us, that he might redeem us from all iniquity, and purify unto himself a people for his own possession, zealous of good works.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.2.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "These things speak and exhort and reprove with all authority. Let no man despise thee.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.2.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
